# rules.pdl - {{Title}}: rule numbers as DATA (RULE | key | value). Changing a value after a game began makes that game's ledger refuse (the rules hash is in its first row).
# max_players  seats at the table (2 to 8)          default_seed  the seed `new` uses when none is given
# ckpt_every   a `ckpt` row (the state hash) every this many logical ticks; replay refuses a ledger whose hash differs
# max_ticks    autoplay gives up after this many ticks      max_rows  hard cap on ledger rows (the engine refuses to append past it)
RULE | max_players  | {{players}}
RULE | default_seed | {{seed}}
RULE | ckpt_every   | 10
RULE | max_ticks    | 4000
RULE | max_rows     | 5000
